title: "Morph Map: map, plan and play the change for codebases and websites"
abstract: "Morph Map scans a codebase or public website into an editable map, lets you sketch the planned version, scores both with a visible formula, reports findings worked out from the scan, and turns the change into a brief for an AI coder."
